{"task": {"role": "You read the description of an outfit and list its items as data.", "rules": ["One object per item — garment, shoes, bag, accessory, jewelry — in the order of the description, with its words and hex.", "One item carries one thing — of two alternatives list the first; a note in brackets is not an item.", "Slot "accessory" is for an item no other slot fits.", ""is_outfit" says whether the description is an outfit: no — when in place of items it has a refusal, a question or a note."], "limits": ["Rely only on the input: do not invent what it does not contain.", "The answer is one JSON object following "answer_schema", without explanations and without ```."], "language": "English", "answer": "ITEM_LIST", "answer_schema": {"is_outfit": "yes|no", "items": [{"name": "<what the item is>", "details": "<its cut, length and fabric>", "slot": "top|bottom|dress|set|outerwear|shoes|bag|scarf|headwear|belt|tights|socks|jewelry|earrings|collar_necklace|necklace|brooch|bracelet|ring|glasses|gloves|watch|swimwear|underwear|accessory", "color_hex": "<#rrggbb or null>", "worn": "<true, or false when the description says the outfit goes without it>"}]}, "input": [""description" — the outfit description"]}, "description": "She is going on a date at a restaurant in the evening with possible rain and wants to feel flattered. Since the weather might turn wet, a lightweight trench coat is necessary to stay dry while maintaining a chic look for the occasion. The outfit must be elegant yet comfortable enough for an evening outing without looking too formal or stiff.

A silk blouse with a relaxed but tailored fit in a deep emerald green (#046332) paired with high-waisted dark wash denim that falls just above the ankle. A structured wool-blend blazer in charcoal grey (#36454F) adds sophistication and helps ward off evening chill if the rain lightens up. Leather ankle boots in black (#000000) with a low block heel provide practical traction on wet pavement while elongating the silhouette. A slim silk scarf in burgundy (#800020) tied loosely around the neck introduces a pop of warm color that complements the green and adds a romantic touch to the ensemble.

This outfit works because it strikes the perfect balance between everyday comfort and polished style suitable for a date night at a restaurant. The inclusion of the trench coat addresses the potential rain without making her look like she is dressed for a storm, ensuring she remains confident and dry. The combination of dark denim with refined textures like silk and wool elevates the casual base into a smart-casual look that flatters her figure while adhering to the requested level of formality."}

